## Feature map

### Photon form (domain)

`PhotonForm` extends BBS `Form` with `ValueString photon_fx` and `ValueBoolean paused`. Serialization and film keyframe tracks follow BBS Values. Keep this class thin and engine-agnostic.

Detail: `docs/architecture/photon-form.md`

### Photon form renderer (adapter)

`PhotonFormRenderer` drives Photon FX for world / film / UI previews: start/stop, pause & scrub freeze, dummy entity, cleanup watchdog. **Known debt:** oversized class with reflection into BBS film UI and Photon internals. New work should extract bridges/passes rather than grow it.

Detail: `docs/architecture/photon-renderer.md`

### Addon registration

Server/common: `BBSPhotonAddon` registers the form type. Client: `BBSPhotonClientAddon` registers renderer, editor panel, icon, L10n; `BBSPhotonClient` wires keyframe factory overrides, track chrome, categories, and tick cleanup.

Detail: `docs/architecture/bbs-addon-hooks.md`

### Photon editor UI

`UIPhotonForm` / `UIPhotonFormPanel` edit effect id and pause; effect picker lists LDLib Photon FX files. `UIPhotonFxKeyframeFactory` customizes film timeline editing for `photon_fx` string tracks.

Detail: `docs/architecture/ui-photon-editor.md`

### Photon 2.2.x compatibility

Roadmap and checklist for moving from older Photon Editor pins (e.g. `2.2.1`) to **`2.2.7`** on NeoForge 1.21.1 while preserving BBS form behavior, and for adding **`.fxpack`** discovery/playback alongside legacy **`.fx`**.

Detail: `docs/architecture/photon2-compat-plan.md`

### Code organization

Package roles, Domain/Adapter boundary, extraction targets for the renderer, and how this addon relates to BBS CML 2.2 / 3.0 practices.

Detail: `docs/architecture/code-organization.md`
